g5oiVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8tVihTODDTyhzeUG5BztH0TqQKnMdWw5FaamtHyjTjeQ&oe=6A355FC1"}, "display_name": "RetroGameDev VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pull up a chair in your own 80s/90s bedroom. The CRT glows, the posters are up, and the tools are waiting. RetroGameDev VR is part time machine, part hands-on workshop: learn how retro hardware really works, create games of your own, and play your creations across the room.\n\n**Learn**\n\nBuilt-in lessons open up the graphics, sound, and inner workings of real retro hardware, showing you how these classic machines tick from the inside.\n\n**Create and Remix**\n\nStart from a template game and make it your own. Use the built-in editors to redraw sprites, repaint palettes, design backgrounds, and compose your own sounds and music.\n\n**Play Your Creations**\n\nPlay the games you make right there in the bedroom. Optional emulator cores can be downloaded in-app if you also want to load your own game files.\n\n**Export to Real Hardware**\n\nTurn your creation into a working cartridge that boots on genuine retro machines, not just inside the app.\n\n**Also Included**\n\nWatch your own video files on any of the three bedroom screens in glorious retro style.\n\n**Emulator Cores**\n\nFree cores for Game Boy / Game Boy Color / Game Boy Advance, NES, and Commodore 64 can be downloaded in-app. No cores or games are bundled. You create your own or load your own game files, and you are responsible for having the right to use any files you load.", "short_description": "Step into an 80s/90s bedroom and discover how classic game machines really work. Learn the hardware from the inside, create and remix your own retro games in built-in editors, and play your creations right there in the room. Then export your game as a real ROM that runs on genuine retro hardware. Part time machine, part hands-on game-making workshop."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "h